<SCENARIO VER="105">
<TXSPN>Now, more importantly, Erina Goto said it a little while ago, did she not?<PG>
That the cause of the tragedy just now was the Kogori couple going near the Arata settlement.<PG>
Then, how could that have been prevented, and a better ending reached?<PG>
I would like to guide you to that route, but for that, we need to go far back in time.<PG>
Yes, back when Natsumi Kogori and the others were still small, there was an event that, though trivial, made the route branch greatly.<PG>
Now then, let us go. I will guide you.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\イラスト\立木三日2.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "立木三日,立木ボード,プレート" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{}
<EVENT VALUE="NOREPAGE">
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
